From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bcrypt: DSA private and V2 blobs, signatures for larger DSA keys

bcrypt: DSA keys now export and import the private BCRYPT_DSA_PRIVATE_BLOB
(version 1, up to 1024 bits) and use the BCRYPT_DSA_KEY_BLOB_V2 layouts for
longer keys (BCRYPT_DSA_PUBLIC_MAGIC_V2 / BCRYPT_DSA_PRIVATE_MAGIC_V2). Keys
over 1024 bits sign and verify 160, 224 and 256-bit hashes and give 64-byte
signatures; the signature size query follows the key.
